# KASHI — A City Beyond Time
#
# Environment template (architecture.md §67).
# Copy to `.env.local` and fill in as needed. Never commit real secrets.
#
# The MVP is intentionally static-first and currently requires no environment
# variables. Add variables here only when a feature genuinely needs them.

# Canonical site origin, used for absolute metadata / Open Graph URLs.
NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=https://thekashiyatra.in

# Private Analytics Dashboard (/saharsh)
# Set your secure custom password for access (default: kashi@saharsh2026)
SAHARSH_ANALYTICS_PASSWORD=kashi@saharsh2026

# Secret key for HMAC cookie signing (optional, a secure fallback is used if omitted)
ANALYTICS_SECRET_KEY=varanasi_kashi_analytics_hmac_secret_2026

# Optional: Vercel Web Analytics REST API credentials
# If provided, the dashboard can also pull aggregate data directly from Vercel's API
# VERCEL_TOKEN=
# VERCEL_PROJECT_ID=
# VERCEL_TEAM_ID=

